WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.891 --> 00:00:18.196
The balloon animals started smashing windows and chasing people.

2
00:00:18.197 --> 00:00:22.409
The clowns laughed and ran off.

3
00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:26.768
Crash! A balloon lion knocked over a hot dog stand.

4
00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:29.741
"My hot dogs!" the owner cried.

5
00:00:29.742 --> 00:00:33.791
"Rocket Girl, help!" a woman cried.

6
00:00:33.792 --> 00:00:37.652
A balloon tiger snapped its jaws at her.

7
00:00:37.653 --> 00:00:40.359
Roxy shot toward the balloon tiger.

8
00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:44.142
The tiger spun around and faced her.

9
00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:48.213
Roxy grabbed it and held it on the ground.

10
00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:52.386
The tiger wriggled free and then rolled on top of her.

11
00:00:52.387 --> 00:00:55.983
"Grr!" Roxy struggled with the big balloon.

12
00:00:55.984 --> 00:00:59.634
She squeezed as hard as she could.

13
00:00:59.635 --> 00:01:03.715
Pop! The balloon tiger zipped back and forth as the air left it.

14
00:01:03.716 --> 00:01:07.270
Soon the lifeless balloon fell to the street.

15
00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:10.982
Roxy quickly popped all the other balloon animals.

16
00:01:10.983 --> 00:01:13.792
Then she went after the clowns.

17
00:01:13.793 --> 00:01:17.260
Terrell, Jack, and Mara were in science.

18
00:01:17.261 --> 00:01:24.229
Terrell pointed out the window. "I see clowns!"

19
00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:29.559
Mara scratched her head. "Why are they jogging?"

20
00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:32.075
Mr. Bubbles stopped jogging.

21
00:01:32.076 --> 00:01:34.752
"Take a break, boys," he said.

22
00:01:34.753 --> 00:01:39.180
"I need . . . to catch . . . my breath."

23
00:01:39.181 --> 00:01:42.255
The other clowns fell over.

24
00:01:42.256 --> 00:01:45.708
"I can't run anymore, boss," one said.

25
00:01:45.709 --> 00:01:48.548
"My legs are tired!"

26
00:01:48.549 --> 00:01:52.648
"It's too bad we left the car," another said.

27
00:01:52.649 --> 00:01:57.289
Mr. Bubbles nodded. "This escape isn't going well."

28
00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:01.656
"There you are!" Roxy swooped down toward the clowns.

29
00:02:01.657 --> 00:02:05.836
"Quick, boys!" Mr. Bubbles cried. "Run!"

30
00:02:05.837 --> 00:02:08.009
The other clowns tried to move.

31
00:02:08.010 --> 00:02:11.375
But police officers arrived and surrounded them.

32
00:02:11.376 --> 00:02:13.885
Roxy didn't see Detective Smith.

33
00:02:13.886 --> 00:02:16.791
"I guess he's still afraid of clowns."

34
00:02:16.792 --> 00:02:18.808
She grabbed Mr. Bubbles' arm.

35
00:02:18.809 --> 00:02:21.803
"You're going back to prison!" she said.

36
00:02:21.804 --> 00:02:28.171
Mr. Bubbles pulled a rubber chicken from his pocket. "Grow!"

37
00:02:28.172 --> 00:02:32.473
The rubber chicken grew fast.

38
00:02:32.474 --> 00:02:37.563
Cluck, cluck! The giant rubber chicken pecked at Roxy.

39
00:02:37.564 --> 00:02:42.900
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blasted it into little pieces.

40
00:02:42.901 --> 00:02:44.672
Terrell looked around.

41
00:02:44.673 --> 00:02:50.697
"Roxy is never around when Rocket Girl shows up," he thought.

42
00:02:50.698 --> 00:02:54.349
Mr. Bubbles squeezed the flower on his jacket.

43
00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:56.813
Smoke poured out.

44
00:02:56.814 --> 00:02:59.492
Roxy felt the clown slip from her hand.

45
00:02:59.493 --> 00:03:03.183
"Where did he go?" Roxy couldn't see anything.

46
00:03:03.184 --> 00:03:04.762
She heard a click.

47
00:03:04.763 --> 00:03:09.798
Roxy used her super breath to blow away the smoke.

48
00:03:09.799 --> 00:03:12.572
Detective Smith stood next to Mr. Bubbles.

49
00:03:12.573 --> 00:03:14.618
The clown was in handcuffs.

50
00:03:14.619 --> 00:03:17.056
"You came!" Roxy said.

51
00:03:17.057 --> 00:03:19.138
Detective Smith nodded.

52
00:03:19.139 --> 00:03:22.299
"I decided to face my fear, just like you said.

53
00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:26.881
Thanks, Rocket Girl."

54
00:03:26.882 --> 00:03:30.961
Roxy walked into school.

55
00:03:30.962 --> 00:03:34.455
"You missed the clowns, Roxy!" Jack said.

56
00:03:34.456 --> 00:03:38.066
"And a giant rubber chicken!" Mara said.

57
00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:41.564
"Really?" Roxy pretended to be surprised.

58
00:03:41.565 --> 00:03:43.956
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

59
00:03:43.957 --> 00:03:48.298
"You also missed Rocket Girl—again."

60
00:03:48.299 --> 00:03:51.135
Roxy just shrugged.
